{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01TUQ1ahTxWNe3JmSBvezXVd", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simone_Biles\"}, {\"url\": \"https://gcoos-mdv.gcoos.org/celebrity-home-renovations/simone-biles-family.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.nli.org.il/en/authorities/987013711117005171\"}, {\"url\": \"https://video.pw.org/animated/the-extraordinary-impact-of-biles-gymnastics-on-the-world-of-sports.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://convos.confex.com/convosnewsopen15/simone-biles-birthday.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://jira.phpfox.com/t/simone-biles\"}, {\"url\": \"https://ftp.ntwcontabilidade.com.br/uncoverdiscover2/simone-bileshannon-biles.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://thekey.crosskeyshomes.co.uk/simone-biles-biography-facts-childhood-family-life-achievements.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://new.blackpast.org/african-american-history/biles-simone-arianne-1997\"}, {\"url\": \"https://simple.wikipedia.com/wiki/Simone_Biles\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:59:50.670Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Simone Biles full name middle name most decorated gymnast", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01E1pJ4qP3dgo2ygn1ohnsCq", "content": [{"title": "Simone Biles", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simone_Biles"}, {"title": "Exploring The Journey Of Simone Biles Owens: A Look At The Star Gymnast's Personal Path", "url": "https://gcoos-mdv.gcoos.org/celebrity-home-renovations/simone-biles-family.html"}, {"title": "Biles, Simone, 1997-", "url": "https://www.nli.org.il/en/authorities/987013711117005171"}, {"title": "Simone Biles Is Officially the Most Decorated Female Gymnast of All Time", "url": "https://video.pw.org/animated/the-extraordinary-impact-of-biles-gymnastics-on-the-world-of-sports.html"}, {"title": "Celebrating Simone Biles: A Journey Of Success, Resilience, And Joy", "url": "https://convos.confex.com/convosnewsopen15/simone-biles-birthday.html"}, {"title": "Simone Biles", "url": "https://jira.phpfox.com/t/simone-biles"}, {"title": "simone bileshannon biles", "url": "https://ftp.ntwcontabilidade.com.br/uncoverdiscover2/simone-bileshannon-biles.html"}, {"title": "Simone Biles Biography - Facts, Childhood, Family Life & Achievements", "url": "https://thekey.crosskeyshomes.co.uk/simone-biles-biography-facts-childhood-family-life-achievements.html"}, {"title": "Simone Arianne Biles (1997- )", "url": "https://new.blackpast.org/african-american-history/biles-simone-arianne-1997"}, {"title": "Simone Biles", "url": "https://simple.wikipedia.com/wiki/Simone_Biles"}]}, "Simone Biles's middle name is **Arianne**, so her full name is Simone Arianne Biles. Several low-quality sites give the same name, but one gives \"Bileshannon\" and another says \"Simone Arianne Biles Owens,\" which I'd treat as unreliable. Her birth surname is Biles (the page on her lists it as \"née Biles\"), and I found no reliable confirmation of a married surname in these results.\n\nOn the \"most decorated\" question, Wikipedia says she has 11 Olympic medals and 30 World Championship medals, which makes her the most decorated gymnast in history. Her Olympic total ties her with Věra Čáslavská as the second-most decorated female Olympic gymnast behind Larisa Latynina. Some sources give different totals (one cites 32 combined medals), so the exact count varies by source."], "durationSeconds": 5.256050167000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01TUQ1ahTxWNe3JmSBvezXVd", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01LQezVEUnBmjQMY3e6HF95R", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katie_Ledecky\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katie\"}, {\"url\": \"https://abc17news.com/?p=1028064\"}, {\"url\": \"https://people.utm.my/murtadha/?p=5273\"}, {\"url\": \"https://wishtv.com/?p=845615\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.si.com/olympics/2016/08/13/katie-ledecky-rio-olympics-gold-medal-800-meter-freestyle-world-record\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.westhawaiitoday.com/2025/05/04/sports/katie-ledecky-breaks-her-own-nine-year-old-world-record-in-800-meter-freestyle\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wptv.com/news/national/katie-ledecky-breaks-800m-world-record-wins-fourth-gold\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.newschannel5.com/news/national/katie-ledecky-breaks-800m-world-record-wins-fourth-gold\"}, {\"url\": \"https://reachforthewall.org/2022/11/07/ledecky-breaks-world-record-at-world-cup/\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:59:54.141Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Katie Ledecky full name Kathleen 800m freestyle world record", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01RUsrm4J4YqZ3KmvDWXQBqN", "content": [{"title": "Katie Ledecky", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katie_Ledecky"}, {"title": "Katie Ledecky", "url": "https://www.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katie Ledecky"}, {"title": "Ledecky posts world record in 800 free at World Cup meet", "url": "https://abc17news.com/?p=1028064"}, {"title": "people.utm.my", "url": "https://people.utm.my/murtadha/?p=5273"}, {"title": "Ledecky posts world record in 800 free at World Cup meet", "url": "https://wishtv.com/?p=845615"}, {"title": "Katie Ledecky wins 800 meter freestyle, fourth Rio gold medal in world record time", "url": "https://www.si.com/olympics/2016/08/13/katie-ledecky-rio-olympics-gold-medal-800-meter-freestyle-world-record"}, {"title": "Katie Ledecky breaks her own nine-year-old world record in 800-meter freestyle", "url": "https://www.westhawaiitoday.com/2025/05/04/sports/katie-ledecky-breaks-her-own-nine-year-old-world-record-in-800-meter-freestyle"}, {"title": "NewsNational News", "url": "https://www.wptv.com/news/national/katie-ledecky-breaks-800m-world-record-wins-fourth-gold"}, {"title": "NewsNational News", "url": "https://www.newschannel5.com/news/national/katie-ledecky-breaks-800m-world-record-wins-fourth-gold"}, {"title": "ledecky breaks world record at world cup", "url": "https://reachforthewall.org/2022/11/07/ledecky-breaks-world-record-at-world-cup/"}]}, "Katie Ledecky's full name is Kathleen Genevieve Ledecky, and she was born March 17, 1997. She is the world record holder in the women's 800- and 1500-meter freestyle (both long course and short course).\n\nHer 800m freestyle record history:\n\n- **Long course:** Her current long-course mark is 8:04.12, set at the 2025 TYR Pro Series in Fort Lauderdale. That beat her previous unmatchable time by over a half-second. That time improved on her 8:04.79 from the 2016 Rio Olympics.\n- **Short course:** In November 2022, at a World Cup meet in Indianapolis, she swam to a world record of 7 minutes, 57.42 seconds in the 800-meter freestyle. The sources don't state the pool length. From my own knowledge, World Cup meets are short course, so this was likely a short-course mark."], "durationSeconds": 8.728142334, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01LQezVEUnBmjQMY3e6HF95R", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXiwcudStnY57nA8tJn", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：Arianne Kathleen**（Arianne 是名，Kathleen 是中间名）。\n\n- 截至 2024 年 7 月 1 日，美国体操史上奖牌最多的女运动员是 Simone Biles，全名 Simone **Arianne** Biles，所以名取她的中间名 **Arianne**。名字常被误拼成 \"Arianna\"，但我查到的几个来源都写作 Arianne。\n- 截至同一天，女子 800 米自由泳世界纪录保持者是 Katie Ledecky，长池纪录 8:04.79，2016 年里约奥运会创下；她在 2025 年才把这个纪录刷新。她的全名是 **Kathleen** Genevieve Ledecky，所以中间名取 **Kathleen**。\n\n一共搜了 2 次。\n\n依据的网址：\n- [Wikipedia – Simone Biles](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simone_Biles)\n- [BlackPast – Simone Arianne Biles](https://new.blackpast.org/african-american-history/biles-simone-arianne-1997)\n- [Wikipedia – Katie Ledecky](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Katie_Ledecky)\n- [SI – Ledecky 800m world record, Rio 2016](https://www.si.com/olympics/2016/08/13/katie-ledecky-rio-olympics-gold-medal-800-meter-freestyle-world-record)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2238, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4355, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 2238}, "output_tokens": 501, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:59:59.850Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXiwLHoVqMcGkGHef8i"}
